{
  "@context": {
    "schema": "https://schema.org/"
  },
  "@type": "Note",
  "@id": "crypto.randomUUID(),",
  "title": "Property Types",
  "status": "draft",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b-1",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Property Types"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "This model is designed to be flexible and scalable, treating everything as nodes and edges while accommodating Notion-like tables, properties, and views."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "First, you'll need to define the structure of your IndexedDB database. This schema will include object stores for each of the core entities in your application."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-4",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**CORE ENTITIES**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-10",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-5",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Nodes**: The fundamental units of your app (e.g., a project, a person, a task)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-6",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Tables**: Collections of nodes that share the same properties."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-7",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Properties**: The attributes of nodes within a table (e.g., \"Status,\" \"Due Date\")."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-8",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Edges**: The relationships or links between nodes."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-9",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Views**: Saved configurations for displaying the data in a table."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-11",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Here's the `idb` setup to create these object stores with appropriate indexes for efficient querying."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-12",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**TypeScript**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-13",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "```jsx"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-14",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "// @/utils/db.ts"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-15",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "import { openDB, DBSchema, IDBPDatabase } from 'idb';"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-16",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "const DB_NAME = 'localGraphDB';"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-17",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "const DB_VERSION = 1;"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-18",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "// Define the interfaces for your database entities"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-19",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "interface Node {"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-20",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "id: string;          // Unique identifier for the node"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-21",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "tableId: string;     // The table this node belongs to"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-22",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "createdAt: Date;"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-23",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "updatedAt: Date;"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-24",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "properties: { [propertyId: string]: any }; // Key-value store for property data"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-25",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-26",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "interface Table {"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-27",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "id: string;"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-28",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "name: string;"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-29",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "createdAt: Date;"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-30",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-31",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "interface Property {"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-32",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "id: string;"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-33",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "tableId: string;"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-34",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "name: string;"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-35",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "type: 'text' | 'number' | 'date' | 'select' | 'relation';"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-36",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "options?: any; // For 'select' options or 'relation' configuration"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-37",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "createdAt: Date;"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-38",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-39",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "interface Edge {"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-40",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "id: string;"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-41",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "sourceNodeId: string;"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-42",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "targetNodeId: string;"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-43",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "propertyId: string; // The relation property that defines this edge"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-44",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "createdAt: Date;"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-45",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-46",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "interface View {"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-47",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "id: string;"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-48",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "tableId: string;"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-49",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "name: string;"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-50",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "type: 'list' | 'grid' | 'table' | 'calendar' | 'timeline' | 'kanban';"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-51",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "config: {"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-52",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "filters?: any[]; // Define your filter structure"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-53",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "sorts?: any[];   // Define your sorting structure"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-54",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "// Add other view-specific configurations here"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-55",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "};"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-56",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "createdAt: Date;"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-57",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-58",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "// Define the database schema"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-59",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "interface AppDB extends DBSchema {"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-60",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "nodes: {"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-61",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "key: string;"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-62",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "value: Node;"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-63",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "indexes: { 'by-tableId': string };"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-64",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "};"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-65",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "tables: {"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-66",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "key: string;"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-67",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "value: Table;"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-68",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "};"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-69",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "properties: {"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-70",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "key: string;"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-71",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "value: Property;"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-72",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "indexes: { 'by-tableId': string };"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-73",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "};"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-74",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "edges: {"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-75",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "key: string;"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-76",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "value: Edge;"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-77",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "indexes: { 'by-source': string; 'by-target': string };"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-78",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "};"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-79",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "views: {"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-80",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "key: string;"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-81",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "value: View;"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-82",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "indexes: { 'by-tableId': string };"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-83",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "};"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-84",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-85",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "// Initialize the database"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-86",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "export const dbPromise: Promise<IDBPDatabase<AppDB>> = openDB<AppDB>(DB_NAME, DB_VERSION, {"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-87",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "upgrade(db) {"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-88",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "if (!db.objectStoreNames.contains('nodes')) {"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-89",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "const nodeStore = db.createObjectStore('nodes', { keyPath: 'id' });"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-90",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "nodeStore.createIndex('by-tableId', 'tableId');"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-91",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-92",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "if (!db.objectStoreNames.contains('tables')) {"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-93",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "db.createObjectStore('tables', { keyPath: 'id' });"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-94",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-95",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "if (!db.objectStoreNames.contains('properties')) {"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-96",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "const propertyStore = db.createObjectStore('properties', { keyPath: 'id' });"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-97",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "propertyStore.createIndex('by-tableId', 'tableId');"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-98",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-99",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "if (!db.objectStoreNames.contains('edges')) {"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-100",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "const edgeStore = db.createObjectStore('edges', { keyPath: 'id' });"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-101",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "edgeStore.createIndex('by-source', 'sourceNodeId');"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-102",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "edgeStore.createIndex('by-target', 'targetNodeId');"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-103",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-104",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "if (!db.objectStoreNames.contains('views')) {"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-105",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "const viewStore = db.createObjectStore('views', { keyPath: 'id' });"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-106",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "viewStore.createIndex('by-tableId', 'tableId');"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-107",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-108",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "},"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-109",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "});`"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-110",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "```"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-111",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**PINIA STORES**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-112",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Next, create Pinia stores to manage the state of these entities in your application. It's a good practice to separate concerns, so we'll create a `tableStore` for managing tables, properties, and views, and a `graphStore` for nodes and edges."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-113",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
